  "description": "Production and storage of liquid rocket propellants: cryogenic LOX (-183C) and LH2 (-253C), refined RP-1 kerosene, hypergolic MMH/N2O4, and solid composite propellants (AP/Al/HTPB). Encompasses cryogenic air separation, steam methane reforming and electrolysis for hydrogen, kerosene fractionation, hydrazine-family synthesis, and vacuum-cast solid grain manufacturing with hazard classification.",
